# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as
# LF everywhere, including Windows. This project is worked on from both a
# Mac and a Windows machine; without this, each one rewrites the other's
# line endings and every file shows as wholly changed in the diff.
#
# Node, Astro, VS Code and Git Bash all handle LF on Windows without
# complaint, so there is no reason to convert on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never inspected as text, never converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
